<title>UK: P&amp;O climbs as NatWest upgrades to &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>P&amp;O climbs as NatWest upgrades to &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in The Peninsular and Oriental Steam Navigation Co Plc advanced 2-1/2p to 611-1/2p, after NatWest Securities analyst Mark McVicar raised his trading advice to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot;, market sources said.</p>
<p>McVicar declined to comment.</p>
<p>-- Louise Ireland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
